  "source_corroboration": [
    "NVIDIA contiguous CP singleton branch selects last_sequence_idx=len(cu_seqlens)-2; common backward kernel reads singleton dht only where i_n equals that selector. Graph test pads static cu_seqlens with repeated final offsets, while CP forward preprocessing computes last-nonempty selection on device.",
